+# Optional. Only needed for realtime collaboration and cloud save (toolbar > folder icon).
+# Without these two, the app runs exactly as before — the Collaborate dialog just
+# says collaboration isn't configured.
+#
+# 1. Create a project at https://supabase.com.
+# 2. Authentication > Sign In / Providers > enable "Anonymous sign-ins" (collaboration)
+#    and keep "Email" enabled (cloud save accounts).
+# 3. SQL Editor > run supabase/schema.sql from this repo.
+# 4. Realtime > Settings > turn OFF "Allow public access" (this app only uses
+#    private, RLS-checked channels).
+# 5. Project Settings > API > copy the Project URL and the publishable key below.
+#
+# For local dev, copy this file to .env.local and fill in the two values.
+# For the GitHub Pages deploy, add them as repository secrets with the same
+# names instead (Settings > Secrets and variables > Actions) — see
+# .github/workflows/deploy.yml.
+
+NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
+NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=
